# Homepage Upcoming Events Section

## Overview

The homepage events block shows **up to 6 active events**. Prefer **upcoming** events; if none exist, fall back to **recent (past)** events with a “Past Event” badge. On the modernist home, use `variant="modernist"` so the section follows Archivo / divider / `mh-event-card` language (same as `/events`), not the classic green glass cards. Canonical implementation: [`src/components/UpcomingEventsSection.tsx`](mdc:src/components/UpcomingEventsSection.tsx).

## Problem Solved

- Users always see event cards on the home page when the tenant has any active events
- Past events appear only when there are no upcoming ones (no empty “no events” when history exists)
- Recurring series show a single next occurrence within one year
- Card layout stays consistent with Featured / Services glass-card homepage patterns
- Fetch is deferred so it does not block first paint ([homepage_deferred_loading_pattern.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/homepage_deferred_loading_pattern.mdc))

## When to Use

- ✅ Homepage events section (modernist or classic home)
- ❌ `/events` list page — use [events_page_filtering_display_rules.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/events_page_filtering_display_rules.mdc) instead
- ❌ Featured strip / hero banners — separate components and rules

## Wiring (KCNJ modernist home)

```tsx
// ✅ DO: Gate with tenant settings; pass modernist variant so cards use mh-* design system
import UpcomingEventsSection from '@/components/UpcomingEventsSection';
import { useTenantSettings } from '@/components/TenantSettingsProvider';

const { showEventsSection } = useTenantSettings();

{showEventsSection !== false && <UpcomingEventsSection variant="modernist" />}
```

```tsx
// ❌ DON'T: Inline a timetable/list that only fetches upcoming and ignores past fallback
// ❌ DON'T: Reimplement card UI inside ModernistHomePage
// ❌ DON'T: Use default (green glass) variant on modernist home — it fights Archivo / divider language
```

- Tenant flag: `showEventsSectionInHomePage` via `useTenantSettings().showEventsSection` (default `true`)
- Modernist page: [`ModernistHomePage.tsx`](mdc:src/components/modernist/ModernistHomePage.tsx)
- Classic MOSC pattern: `<UpcomingEventsSection />` (default) or wrap in `ErrorBoundary` + loading fallback in `HomePageClient` when preferred

## Variants

| Variant | Section shell | Cards | CTAs |
|---------|---------------|-------|------|
| `modernist` (homepage) | `mh-section` + `mh-section-head` / `mh-eyebrow` / `mh-h2` / `mh-link` | Existing `mh-event-card` (same as `/events`) | Colored `mh-btn-*` with icons |
| `default` | `bg-green-50` + `HomeSectionRail` / glass | `UpcomingEventGlassCard` | Image CTAs + admin action buttons |

Modernist CSS for the homepage grid: `.mh-home-events-grid` in [`modernist-homepage.css`](mdc:src/styles/modernist-homepage.css) (single-column stacked cards; reuses `.mh-event-card*`).

## Data Rules

### 1. Active only

- Query: `isActive.equals=true`

### 2. Upcoming first

- Query: `startDate.greaterThanOrEqual={today}` (`YYYY-MM-DD`)
- Sort: `startDate,asc`
- Fetch size: `15` (then process recurring, display max **6**)

### 3. Past fallback (only if upcoming list is empty after processing)

- Query: `endDate.lessThan={today}`
- Sort: `startDate,desc` (most recent first)
- Same size / display limits
- Set section title to **Recent Events** and `isUpcomingEvents = false`

### 4. Recurring events

- Use `isRecurringEvent` / `getNextOccurrenceDate` from `@/lib/eventUtils`
- One card per series (earliest next occurrence)
- Skip if no next occurrence or next occurrence &gt; 1 year from today
- Skip child rows (`parentEventId` / `recurrenceSeriesId` with `isRecurring === false`)

### 5. Media

- Enrich each card with thumbnail from `/api/proxy/event-medias` (first image) when available
- Banner uses `event-card-banner-media--upcoming` + `object-contain` / top-center ([image_containment_prevention_hero_images_cards.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/image_containment_prevention_hero_images_cards.mdc))

### 6. Cache + deferral

- `useDeferredFetch(300)` before network fetch
- `sessionStorage` key from `getHomepageCacheKey('homepage_events_cache', 2)` (versioned for cache-bust), TTL **5 minutes**, store `{ data, timestamp, isUpcoming, hasMore }`

**Do not** add `tenantId.equals` when calling `/api/proxy/...` from new code if the proxy already injects it; existing `UpcomingEventsSection` may still pass it for parity with mosc-temp — prefer matching that file’s current fetch helpers.

## Card Layout (required)

### Modernist (`variant="modernist"`)

- Section: `mh-section mh-home-events` with `mh-section-head` (eyebrow + View calendar link) and `mh-h2`
- Grid: `mh-home-events-grid` — **one event per row**, full width
- Card: `mh-event-card` — **image on top** (`mh-event-card-media`, full container width), **details below** (`mh-event-card-body`)
- Actions: colored icon buttons (`mh-btn-details`, `mh-btn-tickets`, `mh-btn-register`, `mh-btn-donate`, etc.) matching [`events/page.tsx`](mdc:src/app/events/page.tsx)
- When more than 6 events exist after processing: show **See more events** → `/events` (plus header “View calendar”)
- Past badge: `mh-event-card-badge` when `!isUpcomingEvents`
- No green glass, no side-by-side image/details layout

### Default (classic / glass)

- Grid: `grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch`
- Card: `UpcomingEventGlassCard` — rounded-2xl glass face, optional tilt (respects `prefers-reduced-motion`)
- Tint rotation via `cardBackgrounds` / `getRandomBackground(index)`
- Header: `HomeSectionRail` + `HomeSectionTitle` — **Upcoming Events** or **Recent Events**
- Past badge: gray pill when `!isUpcomingEvents`
- CTAs only for upcoming: Register / Buy Tickets / EventCube / Givebutter / Donation (same admission helpers as events page)
- Footer link: `/events` (“View All Events”)

## CSS

- Modernist: `.mh-home-events-*` + shared `.mh-event-card*` in [`modernist-homepage.css`](mdc:src/styles/modernist-homepage.css)
